  title="Chatbot AI ve VILLA SANDY | Hotel PMS Protel"
  description="Investícia do hotelovej AI sa vypláca a prináša hmatateľné výsledky už po 1 mesiaci od implementácie."
  path="/sk/blog/chatbot-ai-ve-villa-sandy"
  bodyClass="use-header-transparent use-menu-secondary-uppercase use-menu-button-uppercase use-headings-link-plain search-panel-hide-submit-label search-panel-hide-close-label search-panel-hide-open-label use-menu-bar use-header-fixed use-header-fixed-mobile use-header-priority use-header-boxed cms-article-read cms-article-article12"
  locale="sk"
